  "title": "习近平春节前夕赴云南考察",
  "date": "2020-01-20 07:56:01",
  "author": "新华社",
  "editor": "(责编：常雪梅                     )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n春节前夕，习近平总书记赴云南考察，看望慰问基层干部群众。19日下午他来到腾冲市清水乡三家村中寨司莫拉佤族村看望乡亲们，走进村民家中了解脱贫攻坚情况，并向大家送上新春祝福。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/48/540777915490569368.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/21/11704031868051944929.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/99/16466904353568137743.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/88/1061422701464108368.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/80/17583974058248653792.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/70/11926114556800352058.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/20/4885406165027244176.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/9/999900810442515513.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/40/5801615118820822712.jpg\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "春节前夕，习近平总书记赴云南考察，看望慰问基层干部群众。19日下午他来到腾冲市清水乡三家村中寨司莫拉佤族村看望乡亲们，走进村民家中了解脱贫攻坚情况，并向大家送上新春祝福。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）"
  ]
